#: includes/class-powned-settings.php:429
msgid "Let through by user agent"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-powned-settings.php:431
msgid "One per line, part of the user agent, for monitoring or feeds you rely on. User agents are easy to fake, so keep this list short. Paths are excluded in \"Never protect\" above."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-powned-settings.php:437
